{% extends 'layouts/app.twig' %}

{% block content %}
    {% set user = auth_user() %}

    <div class="mb-8">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Conectar via SGBD local</h1>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">
            Use qualquer cliente de banco na sua máquina (TablePlus, DBeaver, MySQL Workbench, DataGrip/PhpStorm,
            HeidiSQL...) em vez do phpMyAdmin, se preferir. Conexão direta, sem túnel — o manual abaixo cobre os
            clientes mais comuns.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-6 card">
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Suas credenciais</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
                <p class="field-label">Host</p>
                <p class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-sm text-slate-700">{{ publicHost }}</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="field-label">Porta</p>
                <p class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-sm text-slate-700">{{ externalPort }}</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="field-label">Usuário</p>
                <p class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-sm text-slate-700">{{ user.mysqlLogin }}</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="field-label">Senha</p>
                <p class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-500">A mesma da sua conta aqui na plataforma.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
            Quer trocar esse login? Isso é feito em <a href="/profile" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700">Meu perfil</a>.
            Se seu cliente tiver a opção "Use SSL"/"Usar SSL", pode ligar — o servidor aceita conexão
            criptografada (não é obrigatório, mas é mais seguro numa rede pública).
        </p>
    </div>

    {% if pmaUrl %}
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 bg-emerald-50/60 p-5">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75l2.25 2.25L15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-emerald-900">Mais rápido: use o phpMyAdmin</h2>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-emerald-800">
                    Não precisa instalar nada — abre no navegador com o usuário/senha acima.
                </p>
                <a href="{{ pmaUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary mt-3 !bg-emerald-600 hover:!bg-emerald-700">
                    Abrir phpMyAdmin →
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="mb-6 card">
        <h2 class="mb-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Linha de comando</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Direto, sem túnel — funciona de qualquer lugar.</p>
        <div
            x-data="copyable('mysql -h {{ publicHost }} -P {{ externalPort }} -u {{ user.mysqlLogin }} -p')"
            class="group relative"
        >
            <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-xs text-slate-100"><code>mysql -h {{ publicHost }} -P {{ externalPort }} -u {{ user.mysqlLogin }} -p</code></pre>
            <button
                @click="copy" type="button" aria-label="Copiar comando"
                class="absolute right-2 top-2 rounded-md bg-white/10 p-1.5 text-slate-300 opacity-0 transition-opacity hover:bg-white/20 group-hover:opacity-100"
            >
                <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 17.25v3.375c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-9.75a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V7.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H6.75a9.06 9.06 0 011.5.124m7.5 10.376h3.375c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25c0-4.46-3.243-8.161-7.5-8.876a9.06 9.06 0 00-1.5-.124H9.375c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v3.5m7.5 10.375H9.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125v-9.25m12 6.625v-1.875a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375h-1.5a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375H9.75"/>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-6 card">
        <h2 class="mb-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Manual por SGBD</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-slate-500">
            Os campos são sempre os mesmos, direto — sem túnel, sem passo extra:
            <strong>Host <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1 py-0.5">{{ publicHost }}</code></strong>,
            <strong>Porta <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1 py-0.5">{{ externalPort }}</code></strong>,
            <strong>Usuário <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1 py-0.5">{{ user.mysqlLogin }}</code></strong> e a
            sua senha da plataforma — só muda onde cada ferramenta pede isso.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-2">
            <details class="group rounded-lg border border-slate-200 open:border-slate-300">
                <summary class="cursor-pointer select-none px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">
                    TablePlus
                </summary>
                <div class="border-t border-slate-100 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
                    <ol class="list-inside list-decimal space-y-1">
                        <li>Create a new connection → <strong>MySQL</strong>.</li>
                        <li>Preencha <strong>Host</strong>, <strong>Port</strong>, <strong>User</strong> e <strong>Password</strong> com os valores acima.</li>
                        <li>Clique em <strong>Test</strong> e depois <strong>Connect</strong>.</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group rounded-lg border border-slate-200 open:border-slate-300">
                <summary class="cursor-pointer select-none px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">
                    DBeaver
                </summary>
                <div class="border-t border-slate-100 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
                    <ol class="list-inside list-decimal space-y-1">
                        <li><strong>Database → New Database Connection</strong> → escolha <strong>MySQL</strong>.</li>
                        <li>Na aba <strong>Main</strong>: <strong>Server Host</strong>, <strong>Port</strong>, <strong>Username</strong> e <strong>Password</strong> com os valores acima.</li>
                        <li><strong>Test Connection</strong> — se pedir pra baixar o driver, aceite.</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group rounded-lg border border-slate-200 open:border-slate-300">
                <summary class="cursor-pointer select-none px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">
                    MySQL Workbench
                </summary>
                <div class="border-t border-slate-100 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
                    <ol class="list-inside list-decimal space-y-1">
                        <li><strong>Database → Manage Connections → New</strong>.</li>
                        <li><strong>Connection Method: Standard (TCP/IP)</strong>. Preencha <strong>Hostname</strong>, <strong>Port</strong> e <strong>Username</strong> acima.</li>
                        <li><strong>Store in Vault…</strong> pra salvar a senha, depois <strong>Test Connection</strong>.</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group rounded-lg border border-slate-200 open:border-slate-300">
                <summary class="cursor-pointer select-none px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">
                    DataGrip / PhpStorm
                </summary>
                <div class="border-t border-slate-100 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
                    <ol class="list-inside list-decimal space-y-1">
                        <li>Aba <strong>Database</strong> → <strong>+</strong> → <strong>Data Source</strong> → <strong>MySQL</strong>.</li>
                        <li>Aba <strong>General</strong>: <strong>Host</strong>, <strong>Port</strong>, <strong>User</strong> e <strong>Password</strong> com os valores acima.</li>
                        <li>Se pedir, clique em <strong>Download driver files</strong> (só na primeira vez).</li>
                        <li><strong>Test Connection</strong> (canto inferior esquerdo) e depois <strong>OK</strong>.</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group rounded-lg border border-slate-200 open:border-slate-300">
                <summary class="cursor-pointer select-none px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50">
                    HeidiSQL
                </summary>
                <div class="border-t border-slate-100 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
                    <ol class="list-inside list-decimal space-y-1">
                        <li>Tela inicial → <strong>Nova</strong>, tipo de rede <strong>MariaDB or MySQL (TCP/IP)</strong>.</li>
                        <li>Preencha <strong>Hostname / IP</strong>, <strong>Usuário</strong>, <strong>Senha</strong> e <strong>Porta</strong> com os valores acima.</li>
                        <li><strong>Abrir</strong>.</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </details>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 rounded-lg border border-amber-100 bg-amber-50/60 px-4 py-3 text-xs text-amber-800">
            <strong>Deu erro?</strong>
            "Connection refused" ou timeout: confira se digitou host e porta certinho (sem espaço extra). "Access
            denied" mesmo com a senha certa: confira usuário e senha sem espaço extra (tente digitar em vez de
            colar), ou troque a senha em <a href="/profile" class="font-medium underline">Meu perfil</a> se não
            lembrar a atual.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2 class="mb-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Seus schemas</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Depois de conectar, é um desses databases que você vai selecionar.</p>

        {% if schemas is empty %}
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
                Você ainda não criou nenhum schema — crie um no <a href="/dashboard" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700">seu painel</a> primeiro.
            </p>
        {% else %}
            <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {% for schema in schemas %}
                    <li class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-slate-700">{{ schema.dbName }}</li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
{% endblock %}
